{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a squad of elite mercenaries, experts in post-apocalyptic zombie combat. Battle hordes of the dead as you explore a 3D world revealed through the cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/ca7b0710d41815761c7190c76103a1f5.avif?t=1771169361\" width=616 height=64 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb Choose your tactical approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb Go silent and keep the noise down, picking off enemies one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb Go loud with guns and explosives, drawing the dead at a rapid pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb Set them on fire or blow them up. Slice and dice your orchestrated zombie funeral.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/a58dadf32201560924610e32cf1b4f26.avif?t=1771169361\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb 15 mercenary characters, each individually voiced with different personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb 5 classes with 115 unique skills and special passive perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00bb Unlimited skill respec for endless experimentation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb Reanimate the dead to  transform into a special class, called Revenant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb 17 character specific attributes to fine-tune the combat style even further. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb 350 Steam achievements, view progression directly in the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb 5 challenge modes with Leaderboards to replay the game with alternative rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/f6d736d466278a373379379a51f22e77.avif?t=1771169361\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb Find and upgrade hundreds of weapons, consumables and gadgets for your squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb Over 100 unique items that enhance your skills and transform your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb Meet survivors to join your camp, where they\u2019ll assist you in future missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb Complete 42 side missions with bonus rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/f1ff903f6b136b66555944cabb6075d0.webp?t=1771169361\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Careful Approach","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1533680/f3a5b80a6416f7181f56ec3b2abb2eed67cc75d3.jpg"},{"name":"Challenge Accepted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1533680/4692e5d389a4a2f3464a2cee4fd6579c4d56898d.jpg"},{"name":"Major Medical","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1533680/5b68159899e36cd9f1bab2a0da3b412cdc651d0a.jpg"},{"name":"Skilled Rookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1533680/c851d80899a65b3b5f7df1d99a5c652fb8ff3c25.jpg"},{"name":"Seasoned Soldier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1533680/9aab02ce91965f06ea5c50e8d067811b25f8f46a.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran Death Machine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1533680/8c1b3cf2463a01d15b2873e5bccd907fb37ff337.jpg"},{"name":"Walk Before You Run","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1533680/69abab16afae7bd2b493ba31f251419f95e096cc.jpg"},{"name":"Fast Learner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/