_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/ca7b0710d41815761c7190c76103a1f5.avif?t=1771169361\" width=616 height=64 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb Choose your tactical approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb Go silent and keep the noise down, picking off enemies one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb Go loud with guns and explosives, drawing the dead at a rapid pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb Set them on fire or blow them up. Slice and dice your orchestrated zombie funeral.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/a58dadf32201560924610e32cf1b4f26.avif?t=1771169361\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb 15 mercenary characters, each individually voiced with different personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb 5 classes with 115 unique skills and special passive perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00bb Unlimited skill respec for endless experimentation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb Reanimate the dead to  transform into a special class, called Revenant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb 17 character specific attributes to fine-tune the combat style even further. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb 350 Steam achievements, view progression directly in the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb 5 challenge modes with Leaderboards to replay the game with alternative rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/f6d736d466278a373379379a51f22e77.avif?t=1771169361\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb Find and upgrade hundreds of weapons, consumables and gadgets for your squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb Over 100 unique items that enhance your skills and transform your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb Meet survivors to join your camp, where they\u2019ll assist you in future missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bb Complete 42 side missions with bonus rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/f1ff903f6b136b66555944cabb6075d0.webp?t=1771169361\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p>","developers":["Atom Void"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/53cc4b14e4a8837d462c4bd992e45d64b76dc696/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1771169361","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2026, Atom Void, LLC","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1533680/910348680/a643b157e7735b8514a487070590ae5ba1997c12/1770341190/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770342328","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1533680/910348680/a643b157e7735b8514a487070590ae5ba1997c12/1770341190/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770342328","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1533680/910348680/a643b157e7735b8514a487070590ae5ba1997c12/1770341190/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770342328","id":257277996,"name":"Dead Grid 1.0 Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257277996/1bb88111254dfac146b28022df02ec2e1133343f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770342328"}],"name":"Dead Grid","pack